"├── Idioma (language)\n"
"├── Categoría (category of variables)\n"
"└── Instalación (installation / site)\n"
"    └── Punto de Medida (measure point) ──► mdm.measurement.device\n"
"        └── Variable (sensor variable)  ──► mdm.measurement.device.sensor\n"
